From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: clash-benchmark-bot
 <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 10:33:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use sibling checkouts for clash packages

The Clash benchmark bot benchmarks a clash-compiler checkout that is
not on any release or tag. Replace the source-repository-package
stanzas for clash-compiler, clash-cores and clash-vexriscv with
relative package paths. The benchmark workspace puts these checkouts
next to bittide-hardware.

Drop the frozen versions of the clash packages as well. A frozen
version picks one candidate out of the several that hackage offers,
and there is no choice left to make once the package is a local
directory: the checkout under test is the only clash-prelude in the
plan, whatever version it calls itself. The pin can only reject it,
which is what happens on the 1.10 branch, where the checkout calls
itself 1.10.x and the freeze file asks for the 1.11.0 of master. The
flag assignments stay: those hold for every version.
---
 cabal.project        | 32 +++++++-------------------------
 cabal.project.freeze |  5 -----
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cabal.project b/cabal.project
index 7b5fe2ce..27d195cb 100644
--- a/cabal.project
+++ b/cabal.project
@@ -11,6 +11,13 @@ packages:
   gdb-hs/
   ghc-typelits-extra-lemmas/
   vivado-hs/
+  ../clash-compiler/clash-prelude
+  ../clash-compiler/clash-lib
+  ../clash-compiler/clash-ghc
+  ../clash-compiler/clash-prelude-hedgehog
+  ../clash-compiler/clash-lib-hedgehog
+  ../clash-cores
+  ../clash-vexriscv/clash-vexriscv
 
 write-ghc-environment-files: always
 -- index state, to go along with the cabal.project.freeze file. update the index
@@ -41,13 +48,6 @@ source-repository-package
     clash-protocols-memmap
     clash-bitpackc
 
-source-repository-package
-  type: git
-  location: https://github.com/clash-lang/clash-vexriscv
-  tag: 047f2b393cf2f20f6649d1311a4cbaca1e9fb21e
-  subdir:
-    clash-vexriscv
-
 source-repository-package
   type: git
   location: https://github.com/clash-lang/clash-protocols.git
@@ -56,24 +56,6 @@ source-repository-package
     clash-protocols
     clash-protocols-base
 
